        "Open the Terminal tab for this bootcamp \u2014 every command below runs there.",
        "Type exactly: git status \u2014 the status names your current branch",
        "Type exactly: git log \u2014 the history shows commit entries",
        "Type exactly: git branch \u2014 the branch list includes main",
